Paso is a zero-setup, terminal-based kanban board for personal task management.

Use 'paso tui' to launch the interactive TUI.
Use 'paso task create ...' for CLI commands.

Usage:
  paso [command]

Available Commands:
  assignee    Manage assignees
  column      Manage columns
  db          Manage database connections
  install     Install paso skills and commands for AI tools
  label       Manage labels
  project     Manage projects
  task        Manage tasks

Additional help topics:
  paso completion Generate shell completion script
  paso tui        Launch the interactive TUI

Use "paso [command] --help" for more information about a command.
